WEBVTT

00:51.968 --> 00:55.430
Uh, excuse me, Master.
I'm your pupil, Yeom.

00:55.972 --> 00:58.975
Uh, you have been meditating
for 100 days now.

00:59.059 --> 01:00.351
It is time you go outside.

01:06.316 --> 01:07.484
Master.

01:12.739 --> 01:13.990
Master.

01:17.744 --> 01:18.787
Master…

01:19.913 --> 01:20.830
Master.

01:22.999 --> 01:23.917
Master.

01:24.751 --> 01:25.835
Master.

01:26.795 --> 01:28.630
No. Master.

01:34.594 --> 01:37.263
Oh, dear, that poor, poor thing.

01:37.347 --> 01:40.141
Terrible. Oh, poor thing.

01:40.225 --> 01:42.143
He must have frozen to death.

01:42.227 --> 01:46.481
Goodness me, so it seems.
Gosh, I feel so sorry for him.

01:47.065 --> 01:48.733
What's going on here? What is it?

01:48.817 --> 01:50.985
The homeless boy is dead.

01:51.069 --> 01:54.531
And he was just a young boy.
I feel so bad for him.

01:54.614 --> 01:56.783
Goodness, that poor thing.

02:18.555 --> 02:21.141
As you have always wished,

02:22.392 --> 02:25.395
I will give you a quiet farewell, Master.

02:32.861 --> 02:35.029
Goodness, I feel so bad for him.

02:35.113 --> 02:37.782
Gosh. He seems to be an orphan.

02:37.866 --> 02:39.367
We should hold a funeral for the boy.

02:39.450 --> 02:40.618
- Oh.
- We must do that.

02:40.702 --> 02:42.954
Shall we cremate him
and sprinkle the ashes

02:43.037 --> 02:43.997
- by the lake?
- Oh, my goodness.

02:45.540 --> 02:47.000
The child--

02:47.083 --> 02:48.042
Child, are you all right?

02:49.544 --> 02:51.504
What's going on?

02:52.630 --> 02:55.133
Where is he going? Where is he going?

03:03.892 --> 03:05.393
Stop that now!

03:16.738 --> 03:17.822
Child.

03:17.906 --> 03:20.241
Was it you who spoke just now?

03:22.368 --> 03:23.494
You foolish boy.

03:24.162 --> 03:26.664
I see that you have already burned
my body.

03:27.248 --> 03:28.291
Hmm?

03:29.209 --> 03:31.211
What are you talking about?

03:33.213 --> 03:37.675
Had I been a little later, you would have
burned my cane too, wouldn't you?

03:37.759 --> 03:40.053
Oh, you foolish boy.

03:42.013 --> 03:43.723
You.

03:43.806 --> 03:44.724
You.

03:44.807 --> 03:46.476
You. You fool.

03:47.518 --> 03:49.562
You. You fool.

03:56.486 --> 03:57.987
Is it you, Master?

03:58.071 --> 04:00.531
I shifted my soul from my body

04:00.615 --> 04:02.533
to test if I have reached Hwansu

04:02.617 --> 04:04.869
after my 100 days of meditating.

04:05.453 --> 04:09.249
But I noticed my body was burning,
so I entered this body and ran here.

04:10.333 --> 04:11.542
But I'm too late now.

04:14.087 --> 04:18.549
So then, are you saying
that inside this child's body, it is--

04:18.633 --> 04:20.176
it's really you, Master?

04:20.760 --> 04:21.594
Correct.

04:21.678 --> 04:24.681
It is I, Lee Cheol, your only master.

04:24.764 --> 04:26.099
Oh.

04:27.016 --> 04:28.476
Oh. Master.

04:28.559 --> 04:32.772
Master. Master.

04:42.740 --> 04:44.993
I am a soul shifter.

04:55.253 --> 04:56.337
Your Majesty.

04:56.838 --> 05:00.675
Did you not summon me today
to find the soul shifter?

05:01.301 --> 05:02.552
I will do that.

05:03.344 --> 05:06.431
I can recognize any soul shifter.

05:40.798 --> 05:42.925
Are these the last people
who know your face?

05:47.388 --> 05:48.389
It's an umbrella.

05:49.474 --> 05:50.975
You can take this instead.

05:52.643 --> 05:54.729
Yes.

05:54.812 --> 05:58.441
There is no one else in the capital
who knows I am not blind.

05:59.233 --> 06:02.278
We will make people see
this is a simple fight between thugs.

06:10.828 --> 06:12.789
That's why you should have stopped
looking for me.

06:17.460 --> 06:18.628
Huh? So-i.

06:21.881 --> 06:22.965
You're So-i, right?

06:23.549 --> 06:25.093
Mr. Kim from Sari Village.

06:26.386 --> 06:27.595
You have the wrong person.

06:34.977 --> 06:38.022
He barely knows me.
We've only ever met in passing.

06:38.106 --> 06:39.148
That man…

06:39.774 --> 06:41.192
must be dealt with.

06:52.870 --> 06:54.914
There was no need to kill him too.

06:54.997 --> 06:57.542
We would have never met again
once he returned to Sari Village.

06:57.625 --> 06:58.709
But you did meet.

07:00.753 --> 07:01.712
Sari Village?

07:04.382 --> 07:05.925
Is that where you used to live?

07:09.053 --> 07:10.054
While hiding.

07:11.222 --> 07:14.350
I lived there for a while to hide
from those thugs that you killed earlier.

07:16.102 --> 07:19.605
Is there anyone else, anyone
from Sari Village who might recognize you?

07:20.731 --> 07:23.860
I kept my distance so that no one
would recognize me too easily.

07:24.986 --> 07:26.529
I was a thief there too, you know.

07:26.612 --> 07:28.281
- What's that?
- Money.

07:28.364 --> 07:29.907
It would look suspicious
if a man died at the inn

07:29.991 --> 07:31.534
but still had all his money on him.

07:32.118 --> 07:34.203
You should take it.

07:48.968 --> 07:51.429
I did not want to harm anyone
from Sari Village.

08:03.816 --> 08:05.568
Mu-deok is in the capital.

08:05.651 --> 08:08.696
If I ever see her again,
will I have to kill her too?

08:11.324 --> 08:13.242
Is Broker Kim from Sari Village here?

08:13.826 --> 08:15.828
Yes, second floor.

08:15.912 --> 08:17.121
Last room.

08:25.213 --> 08:26.255
Hmm?

08:49.028 --> 08:50.029
Young Lady Jin?

08:57.745 --> 09:01.749
Wait. What is it you're doing
in a place like this?

09:01.832 --> 09:04.293
What I'm doing here
is none of your business.

09:05.503 --> 09:07.755
And do you perhaps…

09:09.507 --> 09:10.550
gamble?

09:10.633 --> 09:12.510
You… you think I would gamble?

09:12.593 --> 09:16.138
Why would I?
You think I would enjoy such pastimes?

09:16.222 --> 09:17.765
Oh, of course not. No.

09:18.766 --> 09:19.934
But you know,

09:20.017 --> 09:23.354
if you were good enough to not even have
the slightest change in expression

09:23.437 --> 09:25.565
when you were lying about the jade
being broken,

09:26.190 --> 09:28.234
you would probably be a good gambler.

09:32.572 --> 09:34.282
I'm here for tickets from a scalper.

09:34.365 --> 09:37.368
- Hmm.
- A magic show I must see sold out,

09:37.451 --> 09:38.786
that I came here for tickets.

09:38.869 --> 09:40.830
ADMISSION TICKET
SEOCHUN MAGICIANS

09:41.747 --> 09:44.542
- You got two tickets.
- I'm going with my mother.

09:44.625 --> 09:46.377
I want no misunderstandings,

09:46.460 --> 09:48.838
so do not tell anyone
that you saw me here.

09:48.921 --> 09:50.214
That may be difficult.

09:50.298 --> 09:52.842
You know,
I'm not as good of a liar as you.

09:52.925 --> 09:55.720
So I'm not sure if I can tell someone
I didn't see you here.

09:56.804 --> 09:59.682
Still though, I will try my best
for your sake, you know.

10:04.395 --> 10:06.439
Why did I have to run
into her here?

10:11.444 --> 10:13.029
Oh.

10:14.238 --> 10:15.990
Hey. One more bottle.

10:19.368 --> 10:21.037
Why is the leader of Songrim here?

10:24.206 --> 10:28.336
He's not also here to get tickets
to the magic show, is he?

10:30.463 --> 10:33.299
Then I won't be able to go
with Young Master Park.

11:14.256 --> 11:15.549
You…

11:16.676 --> 11:18.219
You killed this man.

11:20.137 --> 11:21.263
I did not.

11:22.014 --> 11:23.140
Why did you kill him?

11:23.641 --> 11:25.017
It really wasn't me.

11:25.101 --> 11:27.061
He was already dead when I got here.

11:32.066 --> 11:33.484
He was killed not long ago.

11:34.318 --> 11:35.403
He died by a single stroke.

11:36.529 --> 11:37.988
This was done by a skilled swordsman.

11:38.656 --> 11:41.117
Yes. I swear it was not me.

11:41.992 --> 11:43.911
I don't even have a sword with me.

12:04.974 --> 12:06.851
It was the same person who did this.

12:08.144 --> 12:09.437
Who are these men?

12:09.520 --> 12:14.483
Oh, uh, th-they were a group of thugs
who recently entered the capital.

12:14.567 --> 12:18.279
Did they come here with Broker Kim
from Sari Village

12:18.362 --> 12:20.614
who stayed in the room down there?

12:20.698 --> 12:21.991
Uh, no.

12:22.074 --> 12:25.661
But I remember, these thugs,
they picked a fight with him

12:25.745 --> 12:26.996
a few days ago.

12:27.079 --> 12:30.332
Oh. They caused a scene
trying to find the whereabouts

12:30.416 --> 12:32.501
of a female swindler from Sari Village.

12:33.085 --> 12:34.920
A swindler from Sari Village?

12:35.629 --> 12:37.214
Could that be Mu-deok, my lord?

12:38.549 --> 12:40.801
Where is she now?

12:45.347 --> 12:47.183
I'm sure she was right behind me.

12:49.727 --> 12:51.020
So she ran away.

13:01.655 --> 13:02.865
What is going on?

13:03.866 --> 13:05.409
What were all those bodies?

13:06.285 --> 13:07.620
They caused a scene

13:07.703 --> 13:10.873
trying to find the whereabouts
of a female swindler from Sari Village.

13:11.832 --> 13:13.250
Could that really be me?

13:14.335 --> 13:17.254
What kind of life has Mu-deok led?

13:17.963 --> 13:19.215
Almost forgot,

13:19.298 --> 13:20.591
did you meet with So-i?

13:20.674 --> 13:22.843
I wonder what mischief she is up to.

13:22.927 --> 13:24.720
Try not to get involved with her.

13:26.889 --> 13:27.932
So-i…

13:29.725 --> 13:31.060
Who is this So-i?

13:34.063 --> 13:36.190
I did not see the girl
who came to find you.

13:36.899 --> 13:39.485
But the guard at the door
got slapped by her during an argument,

13:39.568 --> 13:41.445
so I'm sure he remembers her face.

13:42.905 --> 13:46.075
Excuse me, ma'am, both those guards,
they did not come into work today.

13:46.158 --> 13:48.202
- Really? Both of them?
- Yes.

13:48.285 --> 13:50.788
Very strange. That is just not like them.

13:56.585 --> 13:59.713
We are sorry.
We should not have disrespected a mage.

13:59.797 --> 14:02.424
But there is no need
to do all of this, is there?

14:02.508 --> 14:05.427
A mage?
You lied and said that you were a mage?

14:06.929 --> 14:08.138
I will be soon.

14:08.722 --> 14:12.726
And a member of a noble mage family
at that, far superior to the likes of you.

14:14.895 --> 14:18.524
How dare you talk down to me, you fraud?

14:19.024 --> 14:21.026
I will keep talking down to you,

14:21.986 --> 14:24.822
and you will respect me. Got that?

14:31.579 --> 14:32.788
Go after them.

14:33.372 --> 14:34.790
That is your job.

14:41.714 --> 14:45.134
Is there a girl named Mu-deok
from Sari Village at Chwiseonru?

14:45.217 --> 14:48.554
There is, I know her. So then, was she
the person that you were looking for?

14:49.513 --> 14:52.683
I wanted to ask her to do me a favor
and return something.

14:52.766 --> 14:54.351
Mu-deok is not at Chwiseonru now.

14:54.894 --> 14:56.562
She works as a servant
for the Jang family,

14:56.645 --> 14:57.980
of Cheonbugwan's Gwanju, my lady.

14:58.731 --> 15:00.065
Working as a servant?

15:01.400 --> 15:03.360
I suppose she really is able to see.

15:04.236 --> 15:06.322
Uh, I see she must have fooled you
as well, huh?

15:06.405 --> 15:08.073
We brought her here
thinking she was blind,

15:08.157 --> 15:10.534
but we were shocked
when she opened her eyes and ran off.

15:12.161 --> 15:14.038
But she's not a swindler like me.

15:15.289 --> 15:16.665
How is she able to see?

15:20.628 --> 15:22.296
Please do not kill me. Please.

15:23.213 --> 15:24.214
Sorry.

15:25.007 --> 15:27.217
You recognize my face,
so I cannot let you live.

15:28.427 --> 15:29.637
No. No…

15:53.786 --> 15:57.414
If she was never really blind,
then she might be able to recognize me.

15:59.708 --> 16:01.543
A servant for the Jang family?

16:03.420 --> 16:04.880
I should pay her a visit.

16:07.549 --> 16:09.343
What do you mean Mu-deok committed murder?

16:09.927 --> 16:13.305
Well, several men died
at the ferry inn a few days ago

16:13.389 --> 16:15.849
and Mu-deok was also there.

16:15.933 --> 16:19.687
But Mu-deok is not strong enough
to kill someone.

16:19.770 --> 16:21.647
And especially not enough
to kill several men.

16:21.730 --> 16:23.941
We know it was done
by a skilled swordsman.

16:24.525 --> 16:25.943
So if it wasn't her,

16:26.527 --> 16:28.654
there must have been a mage
who was able to help her.

16:30.155 --> 16:31.115
You are not…

16:32.074 --> 16:33.993
suspecting Young Master Jang, are you?

16:35.119 --> 16:36.370
I am not.

16:36.453 --> 16:39.915
Currently, Jang Uk is at the royal palace
along with Master Lee.

16:41.834 --> 16:42.918
Oh, thank goodness.

16:43.502 --> 16:45.421
But it could not have been
Mu-deok, either.

16:46.005 --> 16:48.257
You know that she has no reason
to harm anyone.

16:48.340 --> 16:49.508
Maidservant Kim.

16:49.591 --> 16:52.970
How much do you know about Mu-deok?

16:54.555 --> 16:57.141
Do you know what kind of life she led

16:57.725 --> 17:01.061
before she started working for it?
Do you know anything?

17:03.147 --> 17:03.981
No.

17:04.064 --> 17:05.024
The dead man

17:05.858 --> 17:08.485
was someone I had met
to ask about Mu-deok's past.

17:10.195 --> 17:12.156
And a group of thugs
who seemed to be looking for her,

17:13.032 --> 17:14.658
they were all killed as well.

17:17.536 --> 17:20.289
It was obvious that she was bound
to be suspected,

17:20.372 --> 17:23.333
but she ran away
instead of proving her innocence.

17:23.417 --> 17:24.543
One thing's clear.

17:24.626 --> 17:26.170
Mu-deok is hiding…

17:27.296 --> 17:30.382
something that must not ever be revealed

17:31.341 --> 17:32.760
to anyone around her.

17:42.728 --> 17:45.314
The guards live over there
if you need to speak with them.

17:45.397 --> 17:47.483
But would it not be faster to instead

17:47.566 --> 17:50.486
just draw a sketch of her
and attempt to find her yourself?

17:50.569 --> 17:52.154
I do not know what she looks like.

17:52.237 --> 17:55.074
- I met her when I was blind.
- But you weren't.

17:56.325 --> 18:00.370
One day, you say you are not blind
and the next day you say that you were.

18:01.580 --> 18:04.500
You live quite the complicated life
or so it seems to me.

18:06.794 --> 18:08.962
Anyway, you do not know
what she looks like,

18:09.046 --> 18:10.047
but she does know you?

18:11.006 --> 18:13.217
Then would it be dangerous
to look for her?

18:13.300 --> 18:16.011
What if she's the one who killed
the thugs and the broker?

18:16.095 --> 18:17.596
She might try to harm you as well.

18:18.931 --> 18:21.767
Being suspected by the leader of Songrim
is more dangerous.

18:24.645 --> 18:27.272
It will put you in a tough spot
since you paid the broker who died.

18:27.356 --> 18:28.607
What do you mean?

18:29.608 --> 18:31.777
I have no idea what you're talking about.

18:32.569 --> 18:33.612
That's good.

18:34.488 --> 18:36.782
It is best you pretend
you do not know anything.

18:37.366 --> 18:39.368
S-someone is dead.

18:39.451 --> 18:41.620
- Someone is dead.
- Someone is dead.

18:42.371 --> 18:44.206
- Look.
- Someone is dead?

18:46.625 --> 18:48.961
That man is dead.

18:49.044 --> 18:50.379
- My goodness.
- He is dead.

18:58.929 --> 19:01.056
Guard Lee and Guard Jang are both dead.

19:09.106 --> 19:12.609
What Hwansu entails is truly impressive.

19:13.277 --> 19:17.447
I truly believe that soul shifters
were all monsters, but in your case,

19:17.531 --> 19:19.616
it is youth and it is eternal life.

19:21.994 --> 19:23.203
It is no wonder that everyone

19:23.287 --> 19:25.914
wanted the ice stone
that makes it possible.

19:26.665 --> 19:29.459
The fights never-ending
because everyone coveted it,

19:29.543 --> 19:31.336
and that is why it was banned.

19:31.420 --> 19:32.796
So, Master Lee.

19:33.714 --> 19:35.632
Since you can recognize soul shifters,

19:35.716 --> 19:37.134
take a look around.

19:37.676 --> 19:40.554
Are there soul shifters
in this palace with us?

19:54.359 --> 19:57.237
Well, I cannot tell
just by simply looking at them.

19:57.321 --> 19:59.489
Because if they do not show
their blue marks

19:59.573 --> 20:01.491
or run wild and become petrified,

20:01.575 --> 20:03.660
they look just like ordinary humans.

20:04.578 --> 20:07.372
Well, then, how do you recognize them?

20:08.290 --> 20:10.250
The fear of being caught. A horror…

20:12.336 --> 20:14.504
of the possibility of being petrified.

20:18.717 --> 20:20.510
So you must bring that out of them.

20:21.094 --> 20:23.889
So you find them by instilling fear?

20:23.972 --> 20:25.766
I apologize if you're disappointed.

20:26.350 --> 20:27.392
Instead…

20:28.685 --> 20:30.854
I would like to give you a gift,
Your Majesty.

20:30.938 --> 20:32.981
You brought a gift? What have you brought?

20:34.233 --> 20:35.400
It is a dog.

20:36.401 --> 20:37.361
A dog?

20:37.444 --> 20:40.113
He is a gentle dog and very clever.

20:40.197 --> 20:42.407
He should be in front
of the royal palace by now.

20:42.491 --> 20:44.534
Do I have your permission
to bring him inside?

20:44.618 --> 20:46.745
You brought him as a gift, so of course.

20:47.537 --> 20:48.705
Bring him in.

20:49.623 --> 20:50.499
Uh, Uk.

20:51.208 --> 20:52.876
I want you to go bring the dog.

20:54.920 --> 20:58.465
And if you're able to do that,
I shall give you a reward.

21:28.662 --> 21:30.872
Should I just leave
and run away with Mu-deok?

21:32.708 --> 21:34.751
But if I do that, everyone will find out.

21:35.794 --> 21:39.631
And right now, I'm not strong enough
to protect my master.

21:44.219 --> 21:46.638
I wonder what Master Lee plans to do.

22:15.042 --> 22:16.251
Assistant Gwanju.

22:17.294 --> 22:18.670
What is it?

22:21.673 --> 22:24.259
Wait, the gift that Master Lee
brought for His Majesty…

22:25.385 --> 22:26.720
The gift is Fluffy?

22:26.803 --> 22:29.931
Master Lee told me that
the dog would follow you back inside.

22:31.099 --> 22:32.309
But still…

22:33.602 --> 22:36.772
Is it really that dangerous
to bring this dog into the palace?

22:37.356 --> 22:38.440
But why though?

22:40.067 --> 22:41.026
Gwigu.

22:41.818 --> 22:43.362
He's going to bring Gwigu in here.

22:44.696 --> 22:45.989
Gwigu is a wily beast.

22:46.907 --> 22:49.451
How could he bring Gwigu into the palace?

22:50.535 --> 22:54.247
Master Seo Gyeong, who was my master
from a long, long time ago,

22:54.331 --> 22:57.876
used Gwigu to find evil relics
created with sorcery

22:57.959 --> 22:59.920
that was using the power of the ice stone.

23:00.003 --> 23:01.713
Yes, I've heard of it.

23:01.797 --> 23:04.758
However, I was told
that it had become useless

23:04.841 --> 23:06.760
after Gwigu's pottery broke.

23:06.843 --> 23:07.803
That's why…

23:08.678 --> 23:11.139
I moved the spirit of Gwigu
from the pottery

23:11.223 --> 23:12.891
into the body of a dead dog.

23:14.601 --> 23:17.020
The dog that is on its way in now…

23:17.771 --> 23:19.022
Gwigu is that dog.

23:21.942 --> 23:22.984
Gwigu?

23:27.531 --> 23:28.615
What should we do now?

23:30.158 --> 23:31.993
How many of our people
are in the palace now?

23:32.577 --> 23:33.745
There are more than ten.

23:34.329 --> 23:35.705
Is there any news from Cheonbugwan?

23:35.789 --> 23:38.667
I sent someone there.
They will be here soon.

24:04.484 --> 24:07.028
This meeting was for Songrim
and the royal family

24:07.112 --> 24:08.864
to finally make peace with one another.

24:09.531 --> 24:12.868
The Crown Prince kindly visited you
and invited you here himself.

24:12.951 --> 24:16.746
But you wish to bring a beast in here
without His Majesty's permission?

24:16.830 --> 24:18.832
I've been granted permission
to bring in the dog.

24:18.915 --> 24:20.709
And Gwigu cannot go wild

24:20.792 --> 24:23.503
or create danger
since it lives inside the body of a dog.

24:23.587 --> 24:26.715
So it cannot harm a soul shifter
even if it sees one?

24:26.798 --> 24:30.302
It will instead let you know by barking.

24:45.734 --> 24:47.319
Why is a dog here?

24:52.741 --> 24:54.034
A soul shifter.

24:54.910 --> 24:59.080
As we suspected, there are more
soul shifters within the palace.

25:04.503 --> 25:05.629
What was that sound?

25:06.379 --> 25:09.591
Does this mean there is a soul shifter
in my palace?

25:09.674 --> 25:10.717
Mm.

25:11.384 --> 25:12.427
It seems that there is.

25:13.136 --> 25:15.639
Then why are you just standing there
like that?

25:15.722 --> 25:18.475
Get out there
and catch the soul shifter right now.

25:18.558 --> 25:21.436
Didn't I tell you before already?
It's a present.

25:21.520 --> 25:24.397
Well then, I'll just leave my gift here
with you and the queen,

25:24.481 --> 25:25.815
so that you may use Gwigu

25:25.899 --> 25:28.401
to catch the soul shifters
by yourself, Your Majesty.

25:29.236 --> 25:31.029
We do not need it, so take it away.

25:31.655 --> 25:34.241
How dare you bring a beast like this
into the palace?

25:34.324 --> 25:38.495
His Majesty already suffers from anxiety.
Are you just trying to bring harm his way?

25:41.289 --> 25:44.918
But, Mother, we were the ones
who invited Master Lee to the palace.

25:45.001 --> 25:46.711
No, it's not your place. Stay out of this.

25:47.587 --> 25:51.174
The mages of Cheonbugwan
are in charge of protecting the palace.

25:51.258 --> 25:52.759
If anything has been made with sorcery,

25:52.842 --> 25:54.427
they will be the only ones
who are responsible

25:54.511 --> 25:55.428
for getting rid of it from here.

25:55.512 --> 25:58.056
A devious beast living inside a dead dog

25:58.139 --> 25:59.933
and the people of Songrim interfering.

26:00.475 --> 26:03.353
It is all but an attempt
to humiliate the royal family.

26:05.397 --> 26:07.274
You must put a stop to this, Your Majesty.

26:35.135 --> 26:37.721
The man who should be protecting
the royal family,

26:37.804 --> 26:40.223
has brought a beast to the palace.

26:41.641 --> 26:43.727
This beast is Master Lee's gift
for the King.

26:43.810 --> 26:45.353
So move aside now.

26:45.437 --> 26:47.772
I cannot disobey His Majesty.
I must bring him inside.

26:53.403 --> 26:54.404
Really?

26:54.487 --> 26:56.406
Then you should try your best
to get inside.

26:56.990 --> 26:58.867
Go and get rid of that trespassing beast.

27:01.244 --> 27:04.331
And if you're able to do that,
I shall give you a reward.

27:04.414 --> 27:07.667
Damn it.
Is this why he picked me to do this?

27:36.112 --> 27:37.822
Your Majesty, it is I, Jin Mu.

27:38.323 --> 27:41.409
I shall get rid of these insolent men
from Songrim for you.

27:41.493 --> 27:44.496
His Majesty invited us to the palace
and we're still talking.

27:44.579 --> 27:46.623
And it is not your place
to interfere here, Jin Mu.

27:46.706 --> 27:49.000
How dare you try to bring that dog in
without permission.

27:49.084 --> 27:50.710
What kind of madness
have you brought to us?

27:50.794 --> 27:52.003
That's enough now.

28:08.436 --> 28:10.730
Guards. What are you doing?
You need to stop that man.

28:15.318 --> 28:16.444
Father.

28:16.528 --> 28:18.113
You must stop both of them.

28:18.196 --> 28:20.448
If this leads to a fight, it will surely
end our relationship with Songrim.

28:21.032 --> 28:21.991
No. We must fight.

28:22.075 --> 28:24.994
Songrim has brought this beast
into the royal palace.

28:25.078 --> 28:26.663
And Cheonbugwan
is simply protecting our family.

28:27.414 --> 28:29.249
- But, Father.
- Your Majesty.

28:33.920 --> 28:35.004
I order…

28:37.048 --> 28:38.133
you all to stop.

28:57.402 --> 28:58.695
You must stop!

29:13.376 --> 29:14.627
Master Lee.

29:14.711 --> 29:17.505
This was a friendly meeting.
Did you have to shock me like this?

29:18.173 --> 29:19.716
I'm sorry for the shock.

29:20.675 --> 29:24.053
But please, if the ice stone
is revealed to the world,

29:24.137 --> 29:26.598
you will see a far bigger conflict
than this.

29:27.182 --> 29:28.266
The ice stone?

29:28.349 --> 29:30.018
Is it because of the soul shifters?

29:30.101 --> 29:31.686
People have used what remains

29:31.770 --> 29:34.773
of the Soul Ejector after the Great Chaos
to shift souls from time to time.

29:35.482 --> 29:39.611
Well, someone is. They seem to be
making that Soul Ejector once more.

29:41.362 --> 29:44.741
The ice stone has come out into the world.

29:50.914 --> 29:51.956
And so?

29:52.040 --> 29:54.209
Where is the ice stone?
And who has a hold of it?

29:54.876 --> 29:56.753
It is probably in the hands of those

29:56.836 --> 30:00.465
who sent the assassin here and turned
a Songrim mage into a soul shifter.

30:00.548 --> 30:02.592
I was told that
Master Seo Gyeong destroyed

30:02.675 --> 30:05.970
all the ice stones years ago
after the Great Chaos.

30:06.054 --> 30:09.974
But it appears he left a few in Songrim
instead of getting rid of them all.

30:10.058 --> 30:13.603
How can human desire be eradicated
because one tries to?

30:13.686 --> 30:14.729
Except…

30:16.064 --> 30:17.524
the ice stone's return

30:17.607 --> 30:21.820
also implies the return of a great man
like Master Seo Gyeong to stop it.

30:24.322 --> 30:27.367
I heard Master Seo Gyeong was born
with the energy of the King's Star.

30:27.951 --> 30:30.078
However, Master Seo Gyeong
didn't become the king.

30:31.788 --> 30:33.164
Do you mean it could be

30:33.832 --> 30:36.459
someone else born with the energy
of the King's Star?

30:41.256 --> 30:43.675
Even if one exists,
the light will be faint

30:43.758 --> 30:46.261
and the energy
of the surrounding seven stars

30:46.344 --> 30:48.054
will not have shown themselves either.

30:49.055 --> 30:51.266
A power that defies the laws of nature

30:51.349 --> 30:53.726
and bring chaos to the world
has returned again.

30:53.810 --> 30:55.228
Which means someone just as strong

30:55.311 --> 30:57.188
should appear to stop it.

30:58.273 --> 30:59.357
That way…

31:00.650 --> 31:03.695
the world will be able to maintain
its balance without complete destruction.

31:09.701 --> 31:14.455
What I mean is, there's simply no need
for Your Majesty to feel so anxious.

31:15.915 --> 31:19.919
Do my words help you calm your anxiety
about the matter?

31:24.883 --> 31:27.135
Thank you for your words of comfort.

31:27.969 --> 31:30.388
Well then, I shall take my leave now.

31:31.264 --> 31:33.600
Since you have refused to accept my gift,

31:33.683 --> 31:36.394
I suppose I will take Gwigu back with me.

31:38.104 --> 31:40.106
- Your Majesty.
- Do as you please.

31:59.459 --> 32:01.753
No, wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

32:02.420 --> 32:04.255
Are we leaving without bringing him in?

32:04.339 --> 32:05.882
I saw everything I had to see.

32:08.343 --> 32:11.471
Does this mean
there is a soul shifter in my palace?

32:11.554 --> 32:13.181
We do not need it, so take it away.

32:13.264 --> 32:15.767
How dare you bring a beast like this
into the palace?

32:17.226 --> 32:19.687
I could see it clearly in their fear.

32:22.649 --> 32:24.359
Oh, dear, were you startled?

32:24.442 --> 32:26.527
Did those bad guys hurt you?

32:26.611 --> 32:28.363
They hurt you?

32:29.113 --> 32:32.158
The dog did not get hurt.
But thanks to you, I certainly did.

32:33.826 --> 32:34.869
You got hurt?

32:35.536 --> 32:38.039
Oh, getting hurt
while fighting those goons.

32:38.122 --> 32:39.916
Still has a long way to go, I see.

32:39.999 --> 32:41.584
Wait.

32:42.168 --> 32:44.087
I see blood. Are you hurt?

32:44.921 --> 32:46.089
That is my blood.

32:46.172 --> 32:48.091
He did not… Ugh?

32:48.174 --> 32:50.218
- What? Blood?
- You're bleeding.

32:50.885 --> 32:52.512
Oh, thank goodness, you're okay.

32:56.683 --> 32:57.684
Hmm…

32:58.226 --> 32:59.519
Does it hurt?

32:59.602 --> 33:01.229
Huh.

33:01.312 --> 33:03.022
It hurts.

33:03.106 --> 33:05.441
It hurts. Ouch.

33:14.993 --> 33:16.995
That Gwigu belongs to Master Lee.

33:17.662 --> 33:20.331
And how much does he actually know
about Mu-deok?

33:21.582 --> 33:23.543
And what will Uk do if he finds out…

33:23.626 --> 33:25.253
…about Naksu?

33:34.053 --> 33:35.138
Are you all right?

33:36.639 --> 33:37.765
You are hurt all over.

33:37.849 --> 33:39.600
I will be fine, all right?

33:39.684 --> 33:42.395
Did you find any soul shifters?
What about the ice stone?

33:42.478 --> 33:45.023
You have no idea.

33:45.815 --> 33:48.067
It was all just chaos over there.

33:48.651 --> 33:51.154
So you caused a scene
but failed to find anyone?

33:51.237 --> 33:54.407
If you brought the dog all the way here,
you should at least let it bite someone.

33:55.283 --> 33:56.367
Uk.

33:56.451 --> 33:58.619
Finding a soul shifter in the royal palace

33:58.703 --> 34:01.039
is different from finding one
in Songrim or Cheonbugwan.

34:02.248 --> 34:03.750
If things escalate,

34:03.833 --> 34:06.335
it will mean the royal family
and Songrim will fight.

34:09.464 --> 34:10.423
Let's go now.

34:10.506 --> 34:11.841
You should get treated at least.

34:12.550 --> 34:13.551
Master Lee.

34:17.096 --> 34:19.098
Please wait here just for a moment.

34:19.182 --> 34:22.268
The Crown Prince has asked me
to escort you to his palace.

34:22.852 --> 34:25.146
- The Crown Prince did?
- It looks like it will rain soon,

34:25.229 --> 34:27.607
and until the rain stops,
he has asked you to stay.

34:29.859 --> 34:30.943
Let us go.

34:38.910 --> 34:40.161
Let's go. You should…

34:40.244 --> 34:42.413
- Right.
- …get him back safely…

34:42.497 --> 34:43.873
- Huh?
- …uh, to Songrim.

34:45.291 --> 34:46.250
Hey, come here.

34:47.877 --> 34:48.878
Come here.

35:01.099 --> 35:03.267
You should have let me know
before the people of Songrim

35:03.351 --> 35:06.270
- made their way into the palace.
- I thought it was…

35:06.854 --> 35:08.981
was just going to be a simple meeting.

35:09.065 --> 35:12.443
If the Queen is put in danger, that means
you will meet the same fate as Eunuch Kim

35:12.527 --> 35:14.654
and become petrified,
you useless imbecile!

35:26.624 --> 35:30.628
A new King's Star who could be
the next Master Seo Gyeong?

35:33.297 --> 35:36.008
The King's Star being created
through sorcery,

35:36.843 --> 35:38.845
would spell the end of Songrim.

35:42.723 --> 35:46.060
Do not worry,
I have sent back Gwigu to Songrim first.

35:47.103 --> 35:49.147
I apologize for startling you.

35:49.230 --> 35:51.482
When a soul shifter was found in Songrim,

35:51.566 --> 35:53.943
I have been on the lookout for one
in the palace as well.

35:54.986 --> 35:58.197
A soul shifter tried to enter
the royal palace the last time too.

35:58.948 --> 36:01.075
I had heard that the person who shifted
in that man's soul

36:01.159 --> 36:02.910
and then killed him was Naksu.

36:07.331 --> 36:08.416
Naksu?

36:10.293 --> 36:13.129
The female assassin
who killed many skilled fighters.

36:13.796 --> 36:15.631
Heads fell to the ground
wherever she went,

36:15.715 --> 36:17.592
which is why she was called Naksu.

36:17.675 --> 36:19.760
There is a rumor that she shifted souls

36:19.844 --> 36:22.054
and they say
that she is still alive today.

36:24.473 --> 36:26.100
A soul-shifting Naksu?

36:27.685 --> 36:29.437
What an interesting rumor.

37:03.679 --> 37:07.558
I hope Mu-deok gets caught
before Young Master Jang returns.

37:09.936 --> 37:11.437
Oh! Oh, my.

37:14.565 --> 37:16.234
Mu-deok…

37:18.527 --> 37:19.904
Why are you shaking?

37:20.529 --> 37:22.865
Do you really believe
that I actually killed someone?

37:24.659 --> 37:26.702
You, come inside now.

37:32.291 --> 37:33.626
Why did you come here?

37:34.710 --> 37:36.045
To pack up your things and run?

37:36.128 --> 37:38.172
I came here so I could ask you
for a favor.

37:38.756 --> 37:40.967
The leader of Songrim asked me
to bring you in if I saw you.

37:41.968 --> 37:43.135
Mu-deok.

37:43.219 --> 37:44.512
It was not you, right?

37:45.221 --> 37:47.056
- It wasn't me.
- Then why did you run away

37:47.139 --> 37:48.349
from the leader of Songrim?

37:48.432 --> 37:50.142
The situation forced me to.

37:51.519 --> 37:52.812
Mu-deok,

37:53.562 --> 37:54.647
is…

37:55.564 --> 37:57.441
there a big secret you're hiding from me?

38:02.947 --> 38:04.156
What you're hiding…

38:05.366 --> 38:07.076
does the Young Master Jang know about it?

38:13.082 --> 38:16.669
Mu-deok, I want you to run away from here.

38:17.253 --> 38:20.006
I will give you enough money.
So just run as far as you can

38:20.089 --> 38:21.215
- and never come back.
- I cannot.

38:22.425 --> 38:24.760
I cannot leave Young Master Jang
no matter what happens.

38:24.844 --> 38:25.970
Why is that?

38:27.346 --> 38:30.474
Our Young Master Jang will only be
suspected if you stay with him.

38:30.558 --> 38:31.892
If you're really worried about him,

38:32.685 --> 38:34.145
then I need you to help me.

38:34.228 --> 38:35.980
You said you cannot tell
the leader of Songrim.

38:36.063 --> 38:37.148
And you will not get out of here.

38:37.732 --> 38:38.899
What do you plan to do?

38:40.735 --> 38:42.570
I have to find the real assassin.

38:44.030 --> 38:48.409
That assassin is going around
and killing everyone who knows them.

38:53.456 --> 38:55.374
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju lives here?

38:56.334 --> 38:58.210
It must be a very prestigious family.

39:00.004 --> 39:03.799
Is there someone from the Jang family
who has also seen your face?

39:06.177 --> 39:09.096
Just go wait over there
and I'll bring that person to you.

39:19.774 --> 39:22.360
First, I am going
to see someone that can testify

39:22.443 --> 39:24.278
that I wasn't in that room at that inn

39:24.362 --> 39:26.030
when all of those people there
were killed.

39:27.406 --> 39:28.699
And who is that?

39:29.283 --> 39:30.659
It is Young Lady Jinyowon.

39:31.660 --> 39:33.245
I ran into her when I was at the inn.

39:34.246 --> 39:37.041
Do you think that mean young lady
will agree to see you?

39:37.666 --> 39:38.793
Maidservant Kim.

39:40.002 --> 39:42.254
Please I need you to take me
into Jinyowon.

39:44.465 --> 39:45.466
Jinyowon?

40:09.323 --> 40:13.494
Oh, I'm very sorry. Could I ask you
to pick up my cane for me?

40:19.959 --> 40:20.918
Thank you so much.

40:21.794 --> 40:24.338
Could you tell me where it is
that I am right now?

40:25.089 --> 40:29.051
Oh, this is the house of Master Jang Gang,
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

40:29.927 --> 40:31.971
Oh. I understand.

40:33.055 --> 40:34.140
Thank you so much.

40:47.403 --> 40:48.654
Mu-deok.

40:48.737 --> 40:49.780
Let's go.

40:57.329 --> 40:59.540
Looks like Mu-deok really can see now.

41:00.166 --> 41:02.126
But she didn't recognize me at all.

41:02.918 --> 41:04.587
I wonder if that's a good thing.

41:08.215 --> 41:09.258
Why are you alone?

41:10.259 --> 41:13.179
I was mistaken.
It turns out I did not know her.

41:14.597 --> 41:17.016
So let us return to Cheonbugwan.
We are done now.

41:29.195 --> 41:31.697
- Can I try it as well?
- No.

41:31.780 --> 41:33.908
Come on. Stop it.

41:33.991 --> 41:35.910
I'm getting all wet.

41:35.993 --> 41:37.620
It is that umbrella.

41:37.703 --> 41:39.163
It's an umbrella.

41:40.122 --> 41:41.999
You can take this instead.

41:45.377 --> 41:48.547
Stop it. My mom is gonna scold me.
Stop it already.

41:49.215 --> 41:52.259
- Who cares if you get wet?
- Hey.

41:52.760 --> 41:55.763
Would you trade umbrellas with me?

41:59.642 --> 42:03.938
Well, I heard that Naksu shifted her soul

42:04.021 --> 42:07.775
into the body of a very tall
and a very burly young man.

42:07.858 --> 42:11.362
She could have also shifted her soul
into the body of a short, petite woman.

42:13.447 --> 42:15.824
If she entered into such a weak body,

42:15.908 --> 42:18.077
there would be no need to try
to get rid of her.

42:19.537 --> 42:20.871
Hmm…

42:20.955 --> 42:22.081
no, I tell you.

42:22.623 --> 42:24.833
They said Naksu in Blue was a man.
They were sure of it.

42:25.626 --> 42:27.044
"Naksu in Blue."

42:27.127 --> 42:28.712
I've heard that nickname before.

42:28.796 --> 42:30.506
He covered himself with a blue cloth.

42:30.589 --> 42:32.299
So, for a while, it became such a trend

42:32.383 --> 42:34.677
that everyone was choosing to wear
a blue cloth.

42:34.760 --> 42:37.137
People wore the blue cloth because

42:37.221 --> 42:40.266
they thought Naksu in Blue would protect
them all from the alchemy of souls.

42:41.976 --> 42:43.978
Though Naksu was a deadly assassin,

42:45.271 --> 42:48.857
she never hurt ordinary people
and was incredibly strong too.

42:53.237 --> 42:56.699
Some people could be very foolish.

42:56.782 --> 42:58.367
It is not that they are foolish.

42:59.243 --> 43:00.494
They are just frightened.

43:03.247 --> 43:05.874
Because people know those murders
were really committed

43:06.709 --> 43:09.503
by those with power and authority
who still remain today.

43:11.297 --> 43:12.756
Condemning such fear

43:13.716 --> 43:15.884
as foolishness is simply negligence.

43:25.144 --> 43:27.062
That is why I gathered this meeting,

43:27.146 --> 43:28.772
hoping to think of a solution
for all of us.

43:28.856 --> 43:32.067
So you ignoring that and criticizing me
is the real arrogance.

43:35.321 --> 43:40.034
Uh, well, while caught between
that negligence and arrogance,

43:40.117 --> 43:42.620
I just wish for some concordance.

43:43.203 --> 43:45.456
Master Lee is also here with us.

43:45.539 --> 43:46.707
So let us drink our tea.

43:49.793 --> 43:51.086
Your Royal Highness.

43:52.087 --> 43:52.921
What now?

43:56.842 --> 43:59.595
Young Lady Heo from the infirmary
wishes to speak.

43:59.678 --> 44:00.679
Let her in.

44:09.188 --> 44:10.481
What brings you here?

44:10.564 --> 44:13.525
I heard someone got into a fight
and is injured.

44:13.609 --> 44:15.235
I came so I could take a look.

44:17.363 --> 44:19.657
There is only one person here
with injuries.

44:19.740 --> 44:22.618
- Take him and treat his wounds.
- No, I'm all right.

44:22.701 --> 44:24.203
It won't take too long.

44:24.286 --> 44:25.412
Please come with me.

44:37.633 --> 44:40.552
We will soon be hearing news
of Uk's engagement again.

44:40.636 --> 44:41.679
How many now?

44:41.762 --> 44:43.764
- What are you talking about?
- You didn't know?

44:43.847 --> 44:46.058
Looks don't lie.
You really don't know anything.

44:46.141 --> 44:48.143
Rumor has already spread.

44:48.227 --> 44:51.939
You three are the top candidates
to be Heo Yeom's grandson-in-law.

44:52.022 --> 44:54.191
The third on her grandfather's list

44:54.274 --> 44:56.110
appears to be the first on her list.

44:57.069 --> 44:59.029
Heo Yeom said it would happen
within the year.

44:59.113 --> 45:01.824
Talks of engagement are coming.
I guarantee that.

45:07.913 --> 45:11.834
The wounds are not too deep, so you can
just take this pill to stop the bleeding.

45:11.917 --> 45:14.753
Why go through this trouble
when I could have gotten it earlier?

45:14.837 --> 45:16.672
Well, I heard you have been hurt earlier.

45:16.755 --> 45:21.135
So I thought that I could feel at ease
if I saw your injuries for myself.

45:24.096 --> 45:24.972
Well…

45:25.597 --> 45:29.935
you already got hurt from your many duels,
and I… I was a little concerned.

45:31.061 --> 45:32.312
Thanks, but I am fine.

45:33.021 --> 45:34.064
Yes.

45:39.403 --> 45:44.575
Oh, right. You know, Maidservant Kim
gave this to me as a gift earlier.

45:44.658 --> 45:47.286
I have not had the chance
to thank her yet.

45:49.079 --> 45:50.372
It looks the same.

45:55.669 --> 45:56.670
What do you mean?

45:58.672 --> 46:01.592
It's the exact same
as the one I've seen for 20 years.

46:01.675 --> 46:03.677
Is this valuable to you?

46:07.055 --> 46:09.850
Hmm. It looks new,

46:09.933 --> 46:11.935
so it does not seem like
she gifted you ours.

46:12.728 --> 46:14.563
Wow, they made it look so similar.

46:15.898 --> 46:16.732
Wow.

46:17.399 --> 46:19.359
The Crown Prince might actually be right.

46:20.486 --> 46:22.654
Uk really might be getting engaged soon.

46:22.738 --> 46:24.698
But to Master Heo, he's third in line.

46:27.034 --> 46:29.369
Hey, first place. Will you marry her?

46:30.412 --> 46:33.457
If you get married, you'll return
to Seoho Fortress, won't you?

46:34.041 --> 46:37.503
Oh, Yul, I'll be lonely.
Don't get married. Hmm?

46:38.670 --> 46:42.257
I can recognize any soul shifter.

46:49.556 --> 46:52.100
It would be best to take her
to Seoho Fortress soon.

46:52.184 --> 46:53.101
Take who?

46:54.102 --> 46:54.978
Me?

47:01.151 --> 47:02.486
I take that back.

47:03.195 --> 47:07.783
After having seen how you reacted today,
I feel very much at ease.

47:08.367 --> 47:09.993
I'm relieved to hear you say that.

47:10.911 --> 47:12.955
What is that that you wish
to ask of me in private?

47:15.123 --> 47:17.709
Would you be willing to give to me

47:17.793 --> 47:19.795
Naksu's sword that you possess?

47:28.470 --> 47:31.557
I did go last year to see the magic show.

47:32.266 --> 47:33.517
I saw elephants.

47:34.017 --> 47:37.229
But I'll act like it's my first time
when I go with Dang-gu.

47:37.312 --> 47:39.857
So you are going to see it
with Young Master Park, huh?

47:39.940 --> 47:42.109
Y-You startled me. Why did you come here?

47:42.192 --> 47:44.736
I have come to ask for a favor from you.

47:44.820 --> 47:45.946
Favor?

47:46.989 --> 47:48.365
Don't bother.

47:48.448 --> 47:51.535
No matter what,
I've no intention of helping you out.

47:51.618 --> 47:53.245
I am being framed for murder.

47:53.996 --> 47:55.122
What?

47:55.205 --> 47:57.499
Can you please go
and talk to the leader of Songrim

47:58.166 --> 48:00.586
and tell him that you saw me earlier
when we were at the inn?

48:01.712 --> 48:05.966
You want me to tell him with my own mouth
that I was there with you?

48:06.049 --> 48:07.843
And to go all the way to Songrim?

48:07.926 --> 48:10.012
Have you gone mad?

48:11.555 --> 48:13.849
I beg of you to help.

48:14.516 --> 48:16.393
I have no one else to turn to.

48:19.479 --> 48:20.647
I won't.

48:20.731 --> 48:22.316
I told him I had an extra ticket.

48:22.399 --> 48:24.610
He can't know
I bought them from a scalper.

48:24.693 --> 48:27.321
Your embarrassment may only last a moment,

48:27.404 --> 48:29.406
but I could really die because of this.

48:29.489 --> 48:32.451
Hmm. And if my mother hears,
I'll die as well.

48:32.534 --> 48:35.287
It's not like
she would really kill her own daughter.

48:35.370 --> 48:37.581
I thought you came for a favor.
Why are you angry?

48:40.334 --> 48:43.629
Then, I suppose I may have
to explain this to your mother

48:44.129 --> 48:45.756
and ask her to help me instead.

48:45.839 --> 48:47.466
You'll tell my mother?

48:48.175 --> 48:50.427
Oh. Look, there she is now.

48:52.804 --> 48:55.933
You didn't need to bring gifts
to apologize for the past.

48:57.142 --> 49:00.646
The more I thought about it,
the more apologetic I felt to the family.

49:02.230 --> 49:04.775
I will just go down there
and ask her myself. All right?

49:04.858 --> 49:05.776
Wait.

49:05.859 --> 49:08.820
I will think about the favor.
Come with me now.

49:17.788 --> 49:19.831
I will be right back.
So just stay right here.

49:20.415 --> 49:21.875
I'll yell if you're not.

49:21.959 --> 49:23.460
- I will come back.
- Cho-yeon.

49:24.252 --> 49:25.379
Yes, Mother.

49:26.171 --> 49:27.005
Wait here.

49:58.328 --> 49:59.705
It is a young girl.

50:01.039 --> 50:02.207
Who is that?

50:31.653 --> 50:33.030
Is it the incense?

50:37.284 --> 50:38.785
What a lovely vase.

50:39.619 --> 50:43.582
It is a precious vase that will make
the flowers in it emit a stronger scent.

50:44.833 --> 50:47.002
- Is that true?
- Yes.

50:47.085 --> 50:50.047
I have wanted to change the vase
in my daughter's room.

50:51.089 --> 50:52.007
This is perfect.

50:55.719 --> 50:58.764
Uh, Mother, are you putting that
in Bu-yeon's room?

50:58.847 --> 51:00.766
It will make the flowers smell stronger.

51:00.849 --> 51:04.519
And your sister cannot see.
She should at least enjoy the scent.

51:05.687 --> 51:06.605
Hmm.

51:48.814 --> 51:50.148
How dare you touch that!

51:50.232 --> 51:52.067
What in the world are you doing
in my daughter's room?

51:56.863 --> 51:58.365
She came with me.

51:58.448 --> 51:59.908
She must have gotten lost somehow.

52:00.492 --> 52:02.744
Mu-deok, why are you in here?

52:05.038 --> 52:06.206
I'm very sorry.

52:11.503 --> 52:13.088
Please leave right now.

52:13.171 --> 52:15.006
You are not allowed inside this room.

52:15.090 --> 52:16.800
Yes. Let's leave.

52:20.387 --> 52:22.222
I will go later. Shh.

52:24.683 --> 52:25.767
Cho-yeon.

52:26.434 --> 52:30.021
Go tell the servants
to clean Bu-yeon's room again.

52:30.772 --> 52:32.607
Yes. Yes, Mother.

53:00.302 --> 53:01.303
So-i.

53:02.304 --> 53:03.972
This man is to be your father.

53:05.056 --> 53:06.183
My father?

53:07.100 --> 53:09.394
This man is willing to take in
a fake daughter?

53:12.898 --> 53:16.693
Jin Bu-yeon was not born
between me and Jin Ho-gyeong.

53:18.028 --> 53:21.573
The biological father is someone else.

53:33.668 --> 53:36.421
To become the daughter of the Jin family,

53:36.504 --> 53:38.381
you must open the door to Jinyowon.

53:38.465 --> 53:42.219
And to do that, the blood
of the Jin family must flow in you.

53:45.764 --> 53:47.098
What are you holding?

53:47.182 --> 53:50.435
This worm has sucked the blood
of a female member of the Jin family.

54:12.499 --> 54:14.626
That is the blood of Cho-yeon in there,

54:15.418 --> 54:16.962
my beloved daughter.

54:18.838 --> 54:21.007
What do you plan on doing with that worm?

54:21.091 --> 54:22.384
Just give me your hand.

54:24.678 --> 54:26.263
I said give me your hand.

55:09.723 --> 55:13.143
You now have the blood
of the Jin family running in your veins.

55:13.977 --> 55:16.396
If I do not use sorcery to keep it alive,

55:16.479 --> 55:19.357
that worm will start eating you
from the inside.

55:20.692 --> 55:22.152
So think twice,

55:23.111 --> 55:25.280
if you ever try running from me.

55:32.495 --> 55:35.165
That room belonged to her daughter
who died ten years ago.

55:36.333 --> 55:37.917
Her daughter apparently drowned,

55:38.668 --> 55:41.212
but that woman is still waiting for her
to come back one day.

55:42.797 --> 55:44.007
Forgive the slap,

55:44.966 --> 55:46.593
because she is a pitiful woman.

55:49.763 --> 55:52.807
By chance, was that woman's daughter
blind too?

55:53.725 --> 55:56.019
Mm-hmm. Yeah, she was.

55:57.312 --> 55:59.814
The owner of this body
used to be blind as well.

56:00.315 --> 56:03.401
Is that why I suddenly felt
that energy earlier?

56:20.126 --> 56:23.254
Master Lee wanted to ask
the Crown Prince something in private.

56:23.880 --> 56:24.881
I see.

56:30.053 --> 56:33.014
The leader has asked us
to escort you to Songrim immediately.

56:33.598 --> 56:35.600
Just me? Why?

56:35.683 --> 56:36.684
Come with us.

56:47.195 --> 56:48.780
Am I getting locked in here again?

56:49.280 --> 56:51.116
- I mean, what's going on here?
- That is--

56:51.825 --> 56:53.159
The leader told us not to say anything.

56:53.952 --> 56:55.161
Wait here until he comes.

57:04.879 --> 57:08.133
Mu-deok was seen at the murder,
so I understand why they took her.

57:08.216 --> 57:10.718
But why Young Master Jang
who was at the palace the whole time?

57:12.095 --> 57:14.639
What did the leader of Songrim say?

57:14.722 --> 57:15.723
I'm not sure, either.

57:18.351 --> 57:19.394
Yul.

57:19.477 --> 57:21.604
There's no way in the world
Mu-deok killed somebody.

57:22.230 --> 57:23.523
Right?

57:26.401 --> 57:28.611
May I please take a look at the bodies
as well?

57:41.458 --> 57:43.334
It was done by a skilled swordsman.

57:43.960 --> 57:45.712
This certainly
could not have been Mu-deok.

57:47.130 --> 57:48.798
She is Naksu, the assassin.

57:49.757 --> 57:51.509
She could have killed those men.

57:56.473 --> 57:58.516
I have a good reason for doing this,

57:59.684 --> 58:00.810
so just be on your way.

58:04.689 --> 58:07.525
- I remember them.
- Do you know these men?

58:09.819 --> 58:12.071
A few days ago,
I got into a fight with these people.

58:17.327 --> 58:19.871
Can I take their bodies now
for their funeral?

58:26.419 --> 58:28.546
Why is the owner of Chwiseonru here?

58:28.630 --> 58:29.672
Has someone died?

58:30.215 --> 58:32.675
Well, yes, our guards
have just been found dead.

58:45.980 --> 58:47.357
Young Master Park.

58:47.440 --> 58:49.359
I just heard from Maidservant Kim.

58:51.277 --> 58:52.403
Young Lady Jin.

58:53.655 --> 58:55.281
I beg you to help Mu-deok, please.

59:03.164 --> 59:06.167
I went to the inn
to buy tickets from scalpers.

59:07.752 --> 59:09.712
And I saw Mu-deok when I was there.

59:10.463 --> 59:12.757
Ugh. Of course,

59:12.840 --> 59:16.636
it was my first time
going to such a place.

59:17.220 --> 59:18.304
I know that.

59:19.138 --> 59:22.892
We talked for a bit,
and right after Mu-deok went inside,

59:22.976 --> 59:24.936
I saw you coming into the inn as well,
my lord.

59:25.770 --> 59:30.316
Of course, I never imagined that you would
frequent a place like that either.

59:31.985 --> 59:33.152
I know that.

59:36.614 --> 59:38.032
I am certain that…

59:39.075 --> 59:43.162
there wasn't enough time for Mu-deok
to have killed all of those men.

59:44.205 --> 59:47.417
They say a girl posing as a mage
came looking for Mu-deok

59:47.500 --> 59:48.960
not very long ago.

59:49.043 --> 59:52.505
The owner of Chwiseonru
thinks there might be a chance that So-i,

59:52.589 --> 59:54.591
the girl that the broker had warned about.

59:54.674 --> 59:57.051
I once saw a girl
who was arguing with the dead thugs.

59:58.386 --> 59:59.637
The thugs,

59:59.721 --> 01:00:01.014
the broker and the guards.

01:00:01.889 --> 01:00:04.142
They all had something to do
with that girl, So-i.

01:00:04.225 --> 01:00:06.102
Yes, So-i seems very suspicious.

01:00:06.936 --> 01:00:09.188
In any case, it was not Mu-deok.

01:00:10.732 --> 01:00:11.774
Very well.

01:00:12.775 --> 01:00:17.363
I also didn't think that Mu-deok
could have committed murder either.

01:00:17.447 --> 01:00:20.158
I knew it. You knew that Mu-deok
is not somebody

01:00:20.241 --> 01:00:21.576
who would do something like this,
didn't you?

01:00:21.659 --> 01:00:25.204
Then could you please release
Uk and Mu-deok as soon as possible?

01:00:25.288 --> 01:00:27.582
The reason why I locked up those two

01:00:28.416 --> 01:00:30.376
was so I can ask them something else.

01:00:31.419 --> 01:00:32.920
I will take care of it from here.

01:00:33.004 --> 01:00:34.130
You may all leave.

01:00:34.213 --> 01:00:35.381
Yeah.

01:00:54.317 --> 01:00:55.568
My lord.

01:00:56.319 --> 01:00:58.279
At least tell me what is going on here.

01:00:59.739 --> 01:01:02.200
Mu-deok committed murder.

01:01:05.328 --> 01:01:06.329
Huh? What?

01:01:06.412 --> 01:01:09.499
She did that to silence all those people
who knew details about her past.

01:01:12.669 --> 01:01:16.381
Tell me, what it is that you and Mu-deok
are hiding from me.

01:01:17.882 --> 01:01:20.259
If your statement
does not match Mu-deok's,

01:01:20.927 --> 01:01:23.221
you cannot leave this Secret Room.

01:01:24.097 --> 01:01:25.848
And that child will die.

01:01:47.161 --> 01:01:48.705
Oh, my lord, I am--

01:01:48.788 --> 01:01:50.123
I'm not asking about the killings.

01:01:52.083 --> 01:01:53.710
Uk has told me everything…

01:01:55.336 --> 01:01:56.587
about your secret.

01:02:00.174 --> 01:02:04.095
If you confess and tell me the truth,
I'll spare your life.

01:02:05.221 --> 01:02:06.389
However,

01:02:06.472 --> 01:02:09.350
if anything that you say
differs from what he has said,

01:02:11.477 --> 01:02:12.937
you will have to die.

01:02:21.863 --> 01:02:23.740
If he found out she was a soul shifter,

01:02:23.823 --> 01:02:25.783
he would not waste time like this.

01:02:25.867 --> 01:02:29.203
He's interrogating us
separately, trying to test us.

01:02:29.287 --> 01:02:31.414
We have to say the same thing.

01:02:33.207 --> 01:02:36.669
What could Uk have said
to answer the same question?

01:02:36.753 --> 01:02:40.590
A secret which ensures
that we say the same thing.

01:02:40.673 --> 01:02:45.678
A secret that is private
but will not get me killed if revealed.

01:02:48.347 --> 01:02:49.807
I will tell you now.

01:02:49.891 --> 01:02:51.267
I will tell you now.

01:02:58.941 --> 01:03:00.401
What has just happened?

01:03:01.402 --> 01:03:05.364
Mu-deok and Uk can both be set free.

01:03:05.865 --> 01:03:08.910
What did they say when questioned?
Did they say the same thing?

01:03:12.121 --> 01:03:15.124
They indeed both said
the exact same thing.

01:03:44.612 --> 01:03:47.490
- You got out.
- You got out too.

01:03:48.074 --> 01:03:50.952
- I'm glad you are safe.
- Yeah, me too.

01:03:51.035 --> 01:03:52.870
We'd be in trouble
if we said different things.

01:03:54.413 --> 01:03:55.915
Well, what did you say?

01:03:55.998 --> 01:03:57.708
The fact that we both got out of there…

01:03:59.085 --> 01:04:01.087
means I said the same thing you did.

01:04:06.259 --> 01:04:09.512
You questioned them separately
to find out what they were hiding.

01:04:09.595 --> 01:04:12.431
It seems you got something
out of them, then. Go on.

01:04:12.515 --> 01:04:14.892
What was their secret? What did they say?

01:04:15.810 --> 01:04:17.228
The two of them…

01:04:18.312 --> 01:04:21.858
told me a secret
that managed to completely shut me up.

01:04:24.735 --> 01:04:27.572
They both showed the exact same thing.

01:04:29.282 --> 01:04:30.533
I will tell you now.

01:04:31.951 --> 01:04:33.286
This is what I hid.

01:04:34.328 --> 01:04:36.122
I tried not to let it show.

01:04:53.764 --> 01:04:55.266
The truth is that I…

01:04:55.766 --> 01:04:58.144
I actually…

01:05:05.109 --> 01:05:06.736
like Mu-deok a lot.

01:05:10.573 --> 01:05:12.408
…like my Young Master a lot.

01:05:18.789 --> 01:05:20.917
I felt that was something
we would both say.

01:05:23.085 --> 01:05:25.463
Since it is not enough to get me killed.

01:05:25.546 --> 01:05:26.464
Indeed.

01:05:27.048 --> 01:05:30.134
Songrim's Book of Regulations
does not state anything

01:05:30.217 --> 01:05:31.761
about punishing people
for falling in love.

01:05:34.931 --> 01:05:35.765
Correct.

01:05:35.848 --> 01:05:39.894
They simply could not kill a servant
for loving her owner to death.

01:05:41.979 --> 01:05:45.274
You said… you really said
you loved me to death?

01:05:47.026 --> 01:05:48.152
Well…

01:05:48.861 --> 01:05:52.073
I just exaggerated
because I had to convince him.

01:05:55.326 --> 01:05:56.702
There was no other option.

01:05:58.245 --> 01:06:01.749
I guess that you had no other choice
but to confess that you love me to death.

01:06:03.167 --> 01:06:04.877
Truly, I feel so bad now.

01:06:05.378 --> 01:06:07.630
I was not as passionate in my statement.

01:06:08.297 --> 01:06:09.590
I guess I should try harder.

01:06:09.674 --> 01:06:10.841
Just forget it.

01:06:12.635 --> 01:06:16.639
Do not ever put your life in danger
for something as fickle as love.

01:06:17.974 --> 01:06:19.892
If something like this happens again,

01:06:20.643 --> 01:06:22.645
and it's a life or death situation,

01:06:24.021 --> 01:06:24.981
give up love…

01:06:26.565 --> 01:06:27.775
and live.

01:06:30.152 --> 01:06:31.988
Do that if you do not wish to die.

01:06:32.071 --> 01:06:33.948
This is an order from your master.

01:06:39.286 --> 01:06:40.413
Hey, Master.

01:06:41.122 --> 01:06:42.623
If I do not mind dying,

01:06:43.457 --> 01:06:45.876
then can I keep doing
what I have been doing?

01:06:48.337 --> 01:06:50.464
I told you that
I'm willing to risk it all,

01:06:51.424 --> 01:06:53.217
and that the two of us
are in this together.

01:06:54.593 --> 01:06:56.220
I will keep going, even if it kills me.

01:06:56.762 --> 01:06:58.222
And you should do the same as well.

01:06:58.848 --> 01:07:01.392
I think it's better
if you stick to your confession.

01:07:02.768 --> 01:07:04.353
And keep loving me to death.

01:07:43.851 --> 01:07:49.273
What would you do if Uk falls in love
with the woman he should not be with?

01:07:49.356 --> 01:07:53.319
If I'm to keep on loving you, of course,
I need to be certain that you are mine.

01:07:53.402 --> 01:07:55.279
How dare you disgrace Jinyowon?

01:07:56.030 --> 01:07:58.449
They're perfect for each other.
Why did they call it off?

01:07:58.532 --> 01:08:00.284
The person I'm looking for is Shaman Choi.

01:08:00.367 --> 01:08:03.204
If Shaman Choi was hunted
by the mages of Cheonbugwan back then,

01:08:03.287 --> 01:08:06.123
are you seeking her because she bears
a grudge against your father?

01:08:06.207 --> 01:08:08.918
If he comes, let me know right away.

01:08:09.001 --> 01:08:10.586
Even though it's dead, it's still Gwigu.

01:08:10.669 --> 01:08:12.546
You are feigning ignorance, right?

01:08:13.214 --> 01:08:15.800
Hey, Yul. It must be tough for you.

01:08:15.883 --> 01:08:18.219
If you must draw that sword
and point it at someone,

01:08:18.302 --> 01:08:20.596
point it at me before anyone else.
